---
description: Database and migration safety for Prisma schema work
globs: prisma/**
alwaysApply: false
---

Before a schema or migration change, read `prisma/schema.prisma`, generated
Prisma types, `docs/architecture/02-domain-model.md`, and
`docs/architecture/10-data-storage-and-retention.md`.

Never guess columns, rewrite migration history, or run production-targeted
commands. Treat migration changes as explicit, reviewable work and select
non-production test coverage from `docs/testing/e2e-strategy.md`.
